## Simple and central

Fifteen square metres, arranged so that nothing is wasted: two single beds, a seating corner by the window, and a flat-screen TV. Tea and coffee are always in the room. Step outside and you are in De Pijp, with the Albert Cuypmarkt at the end of the street and the Rijksmuseum five minutes away by tram.
